e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  patients who will not want to participate to the study\n-  revision surgeries\n-  if the patient is taking antidepressants during the last 6 months\n-  if the patient has a history of a disease that can affect anxiety levels\n-  if patient wants to be excluded from the study\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- patients who will"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "NOT": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "not want to participate to the study"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- revision surgeries",\n              "Observation": [\n                "revision surgeries"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- if the patient is taking antidepressants during the last 6 months",\n              "Drug": [\n                "antidepressants"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- if the patient has a history of a disease that can affect anxiety levels",\n              "Condition": [\n                "disease"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- if patient wants to be excluded from the study"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
