e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Pneumothorax or pneumomediastinum\n2. Life expectancy < 24 hours or expected to require mechanical ventilation for < 24 hours\n3. Condition that precludes placement of an esophageal balloon [esophageal or nasopharyngeal pathology preventing insertion of the esophageal balloon catheter (esophageal ulcerations, tumors, diverticulitis, bleeding varices or in patients with sinusitis, epistaxis or recent nasopharyngeal surgery), severe thrombocytopenia (platelet count < 30) or coagulopathy (INR > 3 or on oral anticoagulants).\n4. Pre-enrollment ICP > 20 mm Hg\n5. Pre-enrollment CPP < 60 mm Hg\n6. Planned change in the external ventricular drain set point during the pre-intervention, intervention or post-intervention periods\n7. Incarceration\n8. Variation in ICP of > 2 cm H2O in the hour prior to intervention.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "1. Pneumothorax",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "Pneumothorax"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or pneumomediastinum",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "pneumomediastinum"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "2. Life expectancy < 24 hours",\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "Life expectancy"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or expected to require mechanical ventilation for < 24 hours"\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "3. Condition that precludes placement of an esophageal balloon [esophageal",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "Condition"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or nasopharyngeal pathology preventing insertion of the esophageal balloon catheter (esophageal ulcerations, tumors, diverticulitis, bleeding varices",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "pathology",\n                                    "ulcerations",\n                                    "tumors",\n                                    "diverticulitis",\n                                    "bleeding varices"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "or in patients with sinusitis,",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "sinusitis"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "epistaxis",\n                                          "Condition": [\n                                            "epistaxis"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "raw_text": "or recent nasopharyngeal surgery).",\n                                          "Condition": [\n                                            "surgery"\n                                          ]\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "4. Pre-enrollment ICP > 20 mm Hg",\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "ICP"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "5. Pre-enrollment CPP < 60 mm Hg",\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "CPP"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "6. Planned change in the external ventricular drain set point during the pre-intervention, intervention or post-intervention periods"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "7. Incarceration"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "8. Variation in ICP of > 2 cm H2O in the hour prior to intervention.",\n          "Observation": [\n            "ICP"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
