e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Adults over 50 years old with degenerative scoliosis (n=20) with pain (>2/10). Other inclusion criteria are: (1) curves 15°-45°.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Adults over 50 years old with degenerative scoliosis (n=20) with pain (>2/10). Other inclusion criteria are:"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "(1) curves 15\\u00b0-"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "45\\u00b0."\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
