e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients with Acute pulmonary oedema\n-  Patients with cardiorespiratory arrest before coronary angiography\n-  hemodynamically unstable patient at diagnosis\n-  patients requiring combined surgery\n-  patients with unstable angina\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients with Acute pulmonary oedema",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Acute pulmonary oedema"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients with cardiorespiratory arrest before coronary angiography",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cardiorespiratory arrest"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- hemodynamically unstable patient at diagnosis",\n              "Condition": [\n                "hemodynamically unstable"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- patients requiring combined surgery",\n          "Condition": [\n            "combined surgery"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- patients with unstable angina",\n      "Condition": [\n        "unstable angina"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
