e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  current use of a smoking cessation medication\n-  women who are pregnant or plan to get pregnant in the coming month\n-  women who might be pregnant\n-  incarcerated individuals\n-  history of sarcoidosis in past 5 years, or active interstitial lung/pulmonary fibrosis\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- current use of a smoking cessation medication"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- women who are pregnant"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or plan to get pregnant in the coming month"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- women who might be pregnant"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- incarcerated individuals"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- history of sarcoidosis in past 5 years,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "sarcoidosis"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or active interstitial lung/pulmonary fibrosis",\n              "Condition": [\n                "interstitial lung",\n                "pulmonary fibrosis"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
