e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n• Liver transplantation candidates with one or more of the following:\n-  inability to perform >4 METs by history\n-  insulin-treated diabetes mellitus\n-  serum creatinine >152μmol/l\n-  history of MI, PCI or CABG\n-  stable angina\n-  cerebrovascular disease\n-  peripheral vascular disease\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "\\u2022 Liver transplantation candidates with one or more of the following:",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "transplantation"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- inability to perform >4 METs by history",\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "METs"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- insulin-treated diabetes mellitus",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "diabetes mellitus"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Drug": [\n                                        "insulin"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "- serum creatinine >152\\u03bcmol/l",\n                                          "Observation": [\n                                            "serum creatinine"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "OR": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "raw_text": "- history of MI,",\n                                              "Condition": [\n                                                "MI"\n                                              ]\n                                            },\n                                            "right": {\n                                              "OR": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "raw_text": "PCI",\n                                                  "Condition": [\n                                                    "PCI"\n                                                  ]\n                                                },\n                                                "right": {\n                                                  "OR": {\n                                                    "left": {\n                                                      "raw_text": "or CABG",\n                                                      "Condition": [\n                                                        "CABG"\n                                                      ]\n                                                    },\n                                                    "right": {\n                                                      "OR": {\n                                                        "left": {\n                                                          "raw_text": "- stable angina",\n                                                          "Condition": [\n                                                            "angina"\n                                                          ]\n                                                        },\n                                                        "right": {\n                                                          "OR": {\n                                                            "left": {\n                                                              "raw_text": "- cerebrovascular disease",\n                                                              "Condition": [\n                                                                "cerebrovascular disease"\n                                                              ]\n                                                            },\n                                                            "right": {\n                                                              "raw_text": "- peripheral vascular disease",\n                                                              "Condition": [\n                                                                "peripheral vascular disease"\n                                                              ]\n                                                            }\n                                                          }\n                                                        }\n                                                      }\n                                                    }\n    