                                          "raw_text": "or disorder which, in the opinion of the investigator, may either put the participant at risk because of participation in the clinical investigation may influence the result of the clinical investigation,",
                                          "Condition": [
                                            "disorder"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "right": {
