e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. (1) Taking medication for leg cramps (eg. Quinine, Magnesium oxide); (2) Other drugs that affect research and evaluation (eg. diuretics, statins, calcium channel blockers, anticonvulsants)\n2. Congenital lower limb musculoskeletal diseases, Lower limb or spine surgery\n3. Uncommunicated or cognitive impaired\n4. Patients refused to be recruited\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "1. (1) Taking medication for leg cramps (eg. Quinine,",\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "Quinine"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "Magnesium oxide); (2) Other drugs that affect research and evaluation (eg. diuretics, statins, calcium channel blockers, anticonvulsants)",\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "diuretics",\n                        "statins",\n                        "calcium channel blockers",\n                        "anticonvulsants"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "2. Congenital lower limb musculoskeletal diseases,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "musculoskeletal diseases"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "Lower limb or spine surgery",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "surgery"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "3. Uncommunicated"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or cognitive impaired",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cognitive impaired"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "4. Patients refused to be recruited"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
