e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Pregnancy\n-  Low back pain associated with menstruation\n-  Currently seeking active treatment for low back pain\n-  Red flags symptoms (i.e. fever, malaise, progressive neurologic deficit, significant trauma, prolonged corticosteroid use or osteoporosis, pain worst at night, urinary or faecal incontinence, or unintended weight loss)\n-  Drug addiction defined as the use of cannabis, opioids or other drugs\n-  Current or previous neurologic, musculoskeletal, mental, or other illnesses which may affect the trial\n-  Current or previous chronic or recurrent pain condition other than low back pain\n-  Current regular use of analgesic medication or other medication which may affect the trial\n-  Lack of ability to cooperate\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- Pregnancy",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "Pregnancy"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- Low back pain associated with menstruation",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "Low back pain"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "menstruation"\n                                      ]\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- Currently seeking active treatment for low back pain",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "low back pain"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- Red flags symptoms (i.e. fever,",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "Red flags symptoms",\n                                    "fever"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "malaise, progressive neurologic deficit, significant trauma, prolonged corticosteroid use",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "malaise",\n                                        "neurologic deficit",\n                                        "trauma"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Drug": [\n                                        "corticosteroid"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "or osteoporosis, pain worst at night, urinary",\n                                          "Condition": [\n                                            "osteoporosis",\n                                            "pain"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "OR": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "raw_text": "or faecal incontinence,",\n                                              "Condition": [\n                                                "faecal incontinence"\n                                              ]\n                                            },\n                                            "right": {\n                                              "OR": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "raw_text": "or unintended weight loss)",\n                                                  "Condition": [\n                                                    "weight loss"\n                                                  ]\n                                                },\n                                                "right": {\n                                                  "raw_text": "- Drug addiction defined as the use of cannabis, opioids or other drugs",\n                                                  "Drug": [\n                                                    "cannabis",\n                                                    "opioids",\n                                                    "drugs"\n                                                  ]\n             