e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Exclusion criteria will include non-English speaking, no working telephone, and less than 5th grade education level.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Exclusion criteria will include non-English speaking,"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "no working telephone,",\n          "Observation": [\n            "telephone"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "and less than 5th grade education level.",\n      "Observation": [\n        "education level"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
