e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Federated boxers\n-  Over 18 years\n-  Male\n-  With non-specific back pain that does not incapacitate them for the realization of their sport or work activity.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Federated boxers"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Over 18 years",\n              "Observation": [\n                "years"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Male"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "-"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "With non-specific back pain that does"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "not incapacitate them for the realization of their sport or work activity.",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "pain"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
