e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  The exclusion criteria were pregnancy, presence of a urinary tract infection and previous treatment for SI. The removal criteria were patient non-compliance with the protocol, failure in contacting the patient and the patient\'s wish to withdraw from the study.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- The exclusion criteria were pregnancy,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "pregnancy"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "presence of a urinary tract infection",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "urinary tract infection"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "and previous treatment for SI.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "SI"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "The removal criteria were patient non-compliance with the protocol,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "non-compliance"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "failure in contacting the patient",\n              "Condition": [\n                "failure"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "and the patient\'s wish to withdraw from the study."\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
