e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\nNon-English Speaking. Any patient who is not able to comprehend and operate the technology at the discretion of the enrolling provider.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "Non-English Speaking."\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "Any patient who is"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "not able to comprehend and operate the technology at the discretion of the enrolling provider."\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
