e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Children who are 6-12 years old，in Chongqing\n-  After birth, three injections of Hep B were inoculated in time according to the procedure of 0, 1 and 6 months（The vaccination certificate record）\n-  No HBV booster vaccine given since primary HBV immunization\n-  Children or guardian knew and agreed to accept the study\n-  Follow - up study and blood collection after vaccination can be accepted\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Children who are 6-12 years old\\u3001in Chongqing"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- After birth, three injections of Hep B were inoculated in time according to the procedure of 0, 1 and 6 months(\\u3001The vaccination certificate record)",\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "Hep B"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- No HBV booster vaccine given since primary HBV immunization",\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "HBV"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Children or guardian knew and agreed to accept the study"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Follow - up study and blood collection after vaccination can be accepted"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
