e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients who underwent fibula free flap for mandibular reconstruction\n-  Patient ≥18 years old\n-  patient alive 6 months after completion of treatment\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients who underwent fibula free flap for mandibular reconstruction"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patient \\u226518 years old"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- patient alive 6 months after completion of treatment"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
