e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Age less than 21 years old\n2. Any prior cancer diagnosis, without or with any treatment (e.g., medical, surgical, or radiation oncology) within prior six months.\n3. Any surgery, i.e., invasive procedure performed in the operating room with any level of anesthesia, within prior month.\n4. Any non-cancer systemic therapy associated with molecularly targeted immune modulation, e.g., monoclonal antibodies.\n5. Any concurrent or prior pregnancy within previous twelve months.\n6. Any history of organ tissue transplantation\n7. Any history of blood product transfusion within prior month.\n8. Any major trauma within prior six months, e.g., burn injury, extremity crush injury, motor vehicle accident, etc.\n9. Unable to provide informed consent.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "1. Age less than 21 years old"\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "2. Any prior cancer diagnosis, without or with any treatment (e.g., medical, surgical, or radiation oncology) within prior six months.",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "cancer"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "3. Any surgery, i.e., invasive procedure performed in the operating room with any level of anesthesia, within prior month.",\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "surgery"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "i.e., invasive procedure performed in the operating room with any level of anesthesia, within prior month."\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "4. Any non-cancer systemic therapy associated with molecularly targeted immune modulation, e.g., monoclonal antibodies.",\n                              "Drug": [\n                                "monoclonal antibodies"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "e.g., monoclonal antibodies.",\n                              "Drug": [\n                                "monoclonal antibodies"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "5. Any concurrent or prior pregnancy within previous twelve months.",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "pregnancy"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "prior pregnancy within previous twelve months.",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "pregnancy"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "6. Any history of organ tissue transplantation",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "organ tissue transplantation"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "7. Any history of blood product transfusion within prior month.",\n              "Observation": [\n                "blood product transfusion"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "8. Any major trauma within prior six months, e.g., burn injury, extremity crush injury, motor vehicle accident, etc.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "trauma",\n            "burn injury",\n            "extremity crush injury"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "9. Unable to provide informed consent."\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
