e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Hysterectomy in a context of gynecologic cancer\n-  Hysterectomy not carried out using laparoscopy\n-  Fimbriated end missing or damaged or impossible for pathologist to analyze\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Hysterectomy in a context of gynecologic cancer",\n          "Condition": [\n            "cancer"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Hysterectomy not carried out using laparoscopy"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Fimbriated end missing",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Fimbriated end"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or damaged",\n              "Condition": [\n                "damaged"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or impossible for pathologist to analyze",\n              "Condition": [\n                "impossible"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
