e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Mental illness limiting the capacity of self-care or any condition limiting seriously the life expectancy less than 12 months.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Mental illness limiting the capacity of self-care",\n      "Condition": [\n        "Mental illness"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "or any condition limiting seriously the life expectancy less than 12 months.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "condition"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "less than 12 months."\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
