e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patient of the CHU Brugmann Hospital receiving elective coronary surgery.\n-  Patient in sinusal rhythm before the operation and during the collection of hemodynamic data.\n-  Patients with conserved left ventricular function (based on left ventricular ejection fraction assessed by preoperative echocardiography and superior to 50%)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patient of the CHU Brugmann Hospital receiving elective coronary surgery."\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patient in sinusal rhythm before the operation and during the collection of hemodynamic data."\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients with conserved left ventricular function (based on left ventricular ejection fraction assessed by preoperative echocardiography and superior to 50%)",\n      "Observation": [\n        "left ventricular ejection fraction"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
