e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Use of any steroid (intravenous [IV] or oral) with a cumulative dose equivalent to ≥ 1 g of methylprednisolone for the treatment of GO within 3 weeks prior to Screening.\n2. Use of rituximab, tocilizumab, or any monoclonal antibody for immunomodulation within the past 9 months prior to Baseline.\n3. Total IgG level < 6g/L at Screening.\n4. Absolute neutrophil count <1500 cells/mm3 at Screening.\n5. Participants with decreased best corrected visual acuity due to optic neuropathy as defined by a decrease in vision of 2 lines on the Snellen chart, new visual field defect, or color defect secondary to optic nerve involvement within the last 6 months at Screening.\n6. Previous orbital irradiation or surgery for GO.\n7. Other, more specific exclusion criteria are defined in the protocol\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "1. Use of any steroid (intravenous [IV] or oral) with a cumulative dose equivalent to \\u2265 1 g of methylprednisolone for the treatment of GO within 3 weeks prior to Screening.",\n                          "Drug": [\n                            "steroid",\n                            "methylprednisolone"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "GO"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "2. Use of rituximab,",\n                              "Drug": [\n                                "rituximab"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "tocilizumab,",\n                                  "Drug": [\n                                    "tocilizumab"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or any monoclonal antibody for immunomodulation within the past 9 months prior to Baseline.",\n                                  "Drug": [\n                                    "monoclonal antibody"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "3. Total IgG level < 6g/L at Screening.",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "IgG"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "4. Absolute neutrophil count <1500 cells/mm3 at Screening.",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "neutrophil count"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "5. Participants with decreased best corrected visual acuity due to optic neuropathy as defined by a decrease in vision of 2 lines on the Snellen chart,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "optic neuropathy"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "new visual field defect,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "visual field defect"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or color defect secondary to optic nerve involvement within the last 6 months at Screening.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "color defect",\n                        "optic nerve involvement"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "6. Previous orbital irradiation or surgery for GO.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "GO"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "7. Other, more specific exclusion criteria are defined in the protocol"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
