e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  The subject must meet all of the following inclusion criteria to participate in this study.\n1. Evidence of pleural disease on chest radiograph or bedside ultrasound or Computed Tomography regardless of underlying aetiology\n2. No age or gender restrictions\n3. Ability to provide informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- The subject must meet all of the following inclusion criteria to participate in this study.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "pleural disease"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "1. Evidence of pleural disease on chest radiograph",\n              "Condition": [\n                "pleural disease"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or bedside ultrasound",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "ultrasound"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or Computed Tomography regardless of underlying aetiology",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "Computed Tomography"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "2. No age"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or gender restrictions"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  "raw_text": "3. Ability to provide informed consent"\n}<|eot_id|>']
