e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients with a compromised medical history.\n-  Severe or active periodontal disease.\n-  Heavy bruxism or a traumatic occlusion.\n-  Acute or chronic dental infection.\n-  Pregnant or breastfeeding women.\n-  Patients with posterior restorations on molars or premolars\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patients with a compromised medical history."\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Severe"\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or active periodontal disease.",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "periodontal disease"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Heavy bruxism"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or a traumatic occlusion."\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Acute"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or chronic dental infection.",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "infection"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Pregnant"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or breastfeeding women."\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients with posterior restorations on molars or premolars"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
