e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. have had a previous diagnosis of any cancer or presence of any tumor other than the CRC\n2. have had inflammatory bowel disease\n3. have had hereditary colorectal cancer syndromes, including Familial adenomatous polyposis, mutyh (MYH)-associated polyposis, Peutz-Jeghers syndrome, Juvenile polyposis coli, phosphate and tension homology deleted on chromosome ten (PTEN) tumor-hamartoma syndromes, Lynch Syndrome, and Familial Colorectal Cancer Type X.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "1. have had a previous diagnosis of any cancer",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cancer"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or presence of any tumor other than the CRC",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "tumor"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "2. have had inflammatory bowel disease",\n              "Condition": [\n                "inflammatory bowel disease"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "3. have had hereditary colorectal cancer syndromes, including Familial adenomatous polyposis, mutyh (MYH)-associated polyposis, Peutz-Jeghers syndrome, Juvenile polyposis coli, phosphate and tension homology deleted on chromosome ten (PTEN) tumor-hamartoma syndromes, Lynch Syndrome,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "hereditary colorectal cancer syndromes",\n                "Familial adenomatous polyposis",\n                "muyh (MYH)-associated polyposis",\n                "Peutz-Jeghers syndrome",\n                "Juvenile polyposis coli",\n                "phosphate and tension homology deleted on chromosome ten (PTEN) tumor-hamartoma syndromes",\n                "Lynch Syndrome"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "and Familial Colorectal Cancer Type X.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "Familial Colorectal Cancer Type X"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
