e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  patients with penetrating abdominal trauma\n-  stable patients not in need for any intervention for conservative management\n-  patients with marked haemodynamic instability\n-  polyt-traumatized Patients\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- patients with penetrating abdominal trauma"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- stable patients not in need for any intervention for conservative management",\n              "Condition": [\n                "trauma"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- patients with marked haemodynamic instability",\n              "Condition": [\n                "haemodynamic instability"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- polyt-traumatized Patients",\n              "Condition": [\n                "polyt-traumatized"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
