e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  patients>18 years old, undergoing elective hepatobiliary surgery under general anesthesia and American Society of Anesthesiologists grade II.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- patients>18 years old, undergoing elective hepatobiliary surgery under general anesthesia"\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "and American Society of Anesthesiologists grade II.",\n      "Condition": [\n        "American Society of Anesthesiologists grade II"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
