e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  All patients aged 18 or older and with a recent (<48h) ICU entry requiring mechanical ventilation for at least 3 days will be considered for enrolment\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- All patients aged 18 or older"\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "and with a recent (<48h) ICU entry"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "requiring mechanical ventilation for at least 3 days will be considered for enrolment",\n          "Observation": [\n            "ventilation"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
