e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Prescription of a Narval CC mandibular advancement device\n-  Age ≥ 18 years\n-  Ability to understand the study information and information on usage of personal data\n-  Signed and dated informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Prescription of a Narval CC mandibular advancement device"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Age \\u2265 18 years"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Ability to understand the study information and information on usage of personal data",\n          "Observation": [\n            "Ability"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Signed and dated informed consent"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
