e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients with cardiovascular disease (congestive heart failure, coronary artery disease, hypertension.\n-  History of renal or hepatic insufficiency\n-  Endocrinal Diseases\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients with cardiovascular disease (congestive heart failure,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cardiovascular disease",\n                    "congestive heart failure"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "coronary artery disease,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "coronary artery disease"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "hypertension.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "hypertension"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- History of renal or hepatic insufficiency",\n              "Condition": [\n                "renal insufficiency",\n                "hepatic insufficiency"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Endocrinal Diseases",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Endocrinal Diseases"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
