e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Patients undergoing minor or laparoscopic surgery\n2. Pregnancy\n3. Patients with severe systemic diseases defined by American Society of Anesthesiologists (ASA) classification III to V\n4. Patients with diabetes mellitus\n5. Patients with planned palliative treatment\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "1. Patients undergoing minor"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "or laparoscopic surgery"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "2. Pregnancy"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "3. Patients with severe systemic diseases defined by American Society of Anesthesiologists (ASA) classification III to V",\n              "Condition": [\n                "diseases"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "4. Patients with diabetes mellitus",\n          "Condition": [\n            "diabetes mellitus"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "5. Patients with planned palliative treatment"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
