e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Adult patients (≥ 18 years) with no age limit;\n-  Patients receiving peritoneal dialysis on the investigation center between 2012 and 2014 (Group1) and between 2016 and 2018 (Group 2);\n-  Patient information in this retrospective study;\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Adult patients (\\u2265 18 years) with no age limit;"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients receiving peritoneal dialysis on the investigation center between 2012 and 2014 (Group1)"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "and between 2016 and 2018 (Group 2);"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patient information in this retrospective study;"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
