e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients who are unable to walk\n-  with a history of cancer\n-  associated neurological diseases\n-  morbid obesity\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients who are unable to walk"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- with a history of cancer",\n              "Condition": [\n                "cancer"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- associated neurological diseases",\n          "Condition": [\n            "neurological diseases"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- morbid obesity",\n      "Condition": [\n        "obesity"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
